ong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"hLlDzRaDGN-0SlEWk0xTpQ","review_id":"_IUHGDsH2HdK2RE263z0Rg","date":"2018-01-20T21:40:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9537696838378906,"text_excerpt":"Breads on Oak is the cutest bakery! The food is worth me going completely out of my way for. I had to try it once I found out they offered vegan breads and pastries. I'm not vegan but I don't eat anything with dairy which is hard to find in most bread, pastries and desserts. They also make their own organic and vegan king cake, including - drumroll - adult/alcohol infused king cakes. I did not get one today but I WILL be trying this before carnival season is over! What I did try: TLTA - basically a vegan BLT substituting tempeh for bacon, mixed greens, avocado, and vegan mayo on multigrain. (Tempeh/Lettuce/Tomato/Avocado). This was delicious. I do eat tempeh on occasion but this one had s..."},{"business_id":"hLlDzRaDGN-0SlEWk0xTpQ","review_id":"vGNcN4DNB8BcVV2K4E4A5A","date":"2013-06-23T02:06:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.940798282623291,"text_excerpt":"I wake up, check Facebook, see for the millionth time that Breads On Oak is serving vegan treats, and decide that enough is enough and promptly put on some pants. After months of putting it off I made it to Breads On Oak and, I must say, that I am an idiot. You mean I could have been going to this place months ago? UGH. Breads On Oak is one of those places that you wouldn't think exists anymore. Where everyone is friendly, and the pastries and breads are on display like pieces of art. The interior is beautiful and everything is super fresh. Really fresh. I got a loaf of ciabatta and could have knocked the whole thing off with some earth balance today--alone, without any help. I think I sw..."},{"business_id":"hLlDzRaDGN-0SlEWk0xTpQ","review_id":"hFiI9lghSy7G_rjUgSZEIQ","date":"2018-03-08T03:18:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.940402090549469,"text_excerpt":"Great vegan bakery with great sandwiches as well! This place and the area is so beautiful, and the patio with outdoor seating outside, when it was alive, they used to have like the biggest and tallest papaya tree in the city with dozens of papayas! It was so cool! Also I love the bakery options, it was great for when I was first going vegan and wanted to try all that stuff too! Sandwiches are great, just make sure to ask for them heated unless you want a cold sandwich, service is great! I once came here and the owner was there, it wasn't too busy and the owner sat down with me and my dad and talked to us about his diet and opening the business for like an hour, it was really cool! Only re..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"hLlDzRaDGN-0SlEWk0xTpQ","photo_id":"HnX-vu7g1r7huhLwxI8Bhg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HnX-vu7g1r7huhLwxI8Bhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8951036930084229},{"business_id":"hLlDzRaDGN-0SlEWk0xTpQ","photo_id":"jlZ6ikCFo78-nUiBXK5zxQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jlZ6ikCFo78-nUiBXK5zxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8901730179786682},{"business_id":"hLlDzRaDGN-0SlEWk0xTpQ","photo_id":"Ey1y1UaMeEUpIToMjnJd3g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ey1y1UaMeEUpIToMjnJd3